{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Buat blok isi artikel blog bergaya retro editorial sesuai gambar referensi.
    
    LAYOUT DAN VISUAL
    - Desktop: dua kolom, isi artikel sekitar 68% di kiri dan sidebar 32% di kanan, sejajar di bagian atas.
    - Latar putih, border tipis abu-abu #8588B0, aksen biru royal/navy #06149B, dan tombol merah #EA080C.
    - Judul panel menggunakan gaya font ChiKareGo2.
    - Paragraf nyaman dibaca menggunakan gaya font Pixolde, heading H2/H3 tebal berwarna biru tua #06149B dengan jarak yang rapi.
    - Blockquote tampil sebagai panel biru royal #06149B dengan teks putih italic dan padding.
    - Jangan menambahkan kutipan contoh jika artikel tidak memiliki blockquote.
    
    ISI ARTIKEL DINAMIS
    - Render isi artikel aktif dari article.content.
    - Pertahankan HTML, gambar, link, daftar, dan format asli artikel.
    - Jangan mengganti isi artikel dengan teks contoh.
    - Di akhir konten, tampilkan tag dari article.tags dengan label TAGS dan pemisah slash.
    - Sembunyikan bagian tag jika artikel tidak memiliki tag.
    - Jangan menduplikasi judul utama artikel, penulis, atau metadata dari blok header sebelumnya.
    
    SIDEBAR PANEL 1: == DALAM ARTIKEL ==
    - Buat daftar isi otomatis dari heading H2 dalam isi artikel.
    - Gunakan nomor 01, 02, 03, dan seterusnya.
    - Teks link mengikuti teks heading asli.
    - Klik item daftar isi menggulir ke heading terkait.
    - Buat ID heading unik jika belum ada, dan pertahankan ID yang sudah ada.
    - Batasi script pada blok ini agar tidak memengaruhi bagian lain.
    - Sembunyikan panel jika tidak ada H2.
    
    SIDEBAR PANEL 2: == GET READY TO RIDE ==
    - Gambar dapat dipilih melalui image picker.
    - Teks promosi dapat diedit, dengan nilai awal:
      “Temukan kit untuk perjalanan berikutnya.”
    - Tombol merah dengan label awal “SHOP COLLECTION >>”.
    - Gunakan collection picker sebagai tujuan tombol.
    - Ambil URL dari koleksi yang dipilih, jangan hardcode link.
    - Jangan tampilkan gambar rusak ketika gambar belum dipilih.
    - Jangan tampilkan tombol dengan tautan palsu ketika koleksi belum dipilih.
    
    PENGATURAN THEME EDITOR
    Sediakan pengaturan yang terhubung ke tampilan untuk:
    - Warna latar, teks, heading, bar panel, dan border.
    - Warna tombol dan teks tombol.
    - Ukuran font.
    - Lebar sidebar, jarak kolom, dan padding.
    - Judul kedua panel.
    - Teks promosi dan label tombol.
    - Image picker dan collection picker.
    - Toggle daftar isi dan panel promosi.
    
    MOBILE DAN AKSESIBILITAS
    - Mobile: satu kolom tanpa overflow.
    - Tampilkan daftar isi sebelum isi artikel.
    - Tampilkan panel promosi setelah isi artikel.
    - Gunakan struktur article/nav/aside yang sesuai.
    - Sediakan indikator fokus keyboard yang terlihat.
    - Gambar responsif dengan teks alternatif.
    - Hormati prefers-reduced-motion untuk smooth scrolling.
    
    BATASAN
    - Jangan buat panel “Sebelum Berangkat”.
    - Jangan tambahkan checklist atau checkbox apa pun.
    - Buat hanya isi artikel dan kedua panel sidebar.
    - Jangan menambahkan header judul artikel.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};padding:{{ block.settings.padding }}px; border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }} }
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }} *, .ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::before, .ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::after{box-sizing:border-box}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout{width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,68fr) minmax(0,{{ block.settings.sidebar_width }}fr);gap:{{ block.settings.column_gap }}px;align-items:start}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article{min-width:0;font-size:{{ block.settings.font_size }}px;line-height:1.75;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article img,.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article video,.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article iframe{max-width:100%;height:auto}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article h2,.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article h3{color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;margin:1.8em 0 .7em}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article h2{font-size:1.65em}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article h3{font-size:1.3em}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article blockquote{margin:1.5em 0;padding:1.25em 1.5em;color:#fff;background:{{ block.settings.panel_bar_color }};font-style:italic}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article a,.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tags a{color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.15em}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article a:focus-visible,.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toc a:focus-visible,.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo a:focus-visible,.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tags a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid {{ block.settings.heading_color }};outline-offset:3px}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sidebar{min-width:0;display:grid;gap:{{ block.settings.column_gap }}px}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel{border:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};min-width:0}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bar{margin:0;padding:12px 16px;background:{{ block.settings.panel_bar_color }};color:#fff;font-size:16px;line-height:1.3;font-family:'ChiKareGo2',{{ settings.type_heading_font.family }},monospace;font-weight:700}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toc{padding:14px 16px}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toc ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;counter-reset:editorial-toc}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toc li{counter-increment:editorial-toc;display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.5em minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};line-height:1.4}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toc li:last-child{border-bottom:0}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toc li::before{content:counter(editorial-toc,decimal-leading-zero);color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font-weight:700}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toc a{color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};text-decoration:none}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo-content{padding:16px}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo-image{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:14px}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo-text{margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.55; font-family: Pixolde; font-weight: 700; color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }} }.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button{display:block;max-width:100%;padding:12px 14px;background:{{ block.settings.button_color }};color:{{ block.settings.button_text_color }};text-align:center;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tags{margin-top:2em;padding-top:1em;border-top:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:baseline}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tags-label{color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font-weight:700;margin-right:5px}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tag-separator{color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}
@media(max-width:749px){.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:{{ block.settings.padding | at_most: 32 }}px}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout{width:100%;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:{{ block.settings.column_gap }}px}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sidebar{display:contents}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toc-panel{order:1}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article{order:2}.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo-panel{order:3}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}{scroll-behavior:auto}}
{% endstyle %}
<blog-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-enable-toc="{{ block.settings.show_toc }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout">
<article class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__article" data-editorial-content>
{% if article != blank %}{{ article.content }}{% if article.tags.size > 0 %}<div class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tags"><span class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tags-label">TAGS</span>{% for tag in article.tags %}{% unless forloop.first %}<span class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tag-separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span>{% endunless %}<a href="{{ blog.url }}/tagged/{{ tag | handle }}">{{ tag | escape }}</a>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}{% endif %}
</article>
<aside class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sidebar" aria-label="Artikel terkait">
{% if block.settings.show_toc %}<nav class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toc-panel" data-toc-panel aria-label="Daftar isi"><h2 class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bar">{{ block.settings.toc_title | escape }}</h2><div class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toc"><ol data-toc-list></ol></div></nav>{% endif %}
{% if block.settings.show_promo %}<section class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo-panel"><h2 class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bar">{{ block.settings.promo_title | escape }}</h2><div class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo-content">{% if block.settings.promo_image != blank %}<img class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo-image" src="{{ block.settings.promo_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.promo_image.alt | escape }}" width="{{ block.settings.promo_image.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.promo_image.height }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}{% if block.settings.promo_text != blank %}<p class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo-text">{{ block.settings.promo_text | escape }}</p>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.promo_collection != blank %}<a class="ai-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button" href="{{ block.settings.promo_collection.url }}">{{ block.settings.button_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}</div></section>{% endif %}
</aside></div></blog-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(()=>{const name='blog-editorial-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(name))return;class BlogEditorial extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){if(this.dataset.enableToc!=='true')return;const content=this.querySelector('[data-editorial-content]'),panel=this.querySelector('[data-toc-panel]'),list=this.querySelector('[data-toc-list]');if(!content||!panel||!list)return;const headings=content.querySelectorAll('h2');if(!headings.length){panel.hidden=true;return}const used=new Set();headings.forEach(heading=>{let base=heading.id||heading.textContent.trim().toLowerCase().replace(/[^\p{L}\p{N}]+/gu,'-').replace(/^-|-$/g,'')||'bagian',id=base,suffix=2;while(used.has(id)||(document.getElementById(id)&&document.getElementById(id)!==heading))id=`${base}-${suffix++}`;if(!heading.id)heading.id=id;used.add(heading.id);const item=document.createElement('li'),link=document.createElement('a');link.href=`#${heading.id}`;link.textContent=heading.textContent.trim();link.addEventListener('click',event=>{event.preventDefault();heading.scrollIntoView({behavior:matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches?'auto':'smooth',block:'start'});history.replaceState(null,'',`#${encodeURIComponent(heading.id)}`);heading.setAttribute('tabindex','-1');heading.focus({preventScroll:true})});item.appendChild(link);list.appendChild(item)})}}customElements.define(name,BlogEditorial)})();</script>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Retro blog editorial","settings":[{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"header","content":"Layout and color"},{"type":"range","id":"sidebar_width","label":"Sidebar width","min":20,"max":50,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":30},{"type":"range","id":"column_gap","label":"Column gap","min":8,"max":48,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":24},{"type":"range","id":"padding","label":"Padding","min":0,"max":60,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":24},{"type":"range","id":"font_size","label":"Body font size","min":12,"max":24,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":16},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#FFFFFF"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text","default":"#151515"},{"type":"color","id":"heading_color","label":"Headings","default":"#06149B"},{"type":"color","id":"panel_bar_color","label":"Panel bar","default":"#06149B"},{"type":"color","id":"border_color","label":"Border","default":"#8588B0"},{"type":"color","id":"button_color","label":"Button","default":"#EA080C"},{"type":"color","id":"button_text_color","label":"Button text","default":"#FFFFFF"},{"type":"header","content":"Contents panel"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_toc","label":"Show contents panel","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"toc_title","label":"Panel title","default":"== DALAM ARTIKEL"},{"type":"header","content":"Promotion panel"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_promo","label":"Show promotion panel","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"promo_title","label":"Panel title","default":"== GET READY TO RIDE"},{"type":"text","id":"promo_text","label":"Promotion text","default":"Temukan kit untuk perjalanan berikutnya."},{"type":"text","id":"button_label","label":"Button label","default":"SHOP COLLECTION >>"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"promo_image","label":"Promotion image"},{"type":"collection","id":"promo_collection","label":"Button collection"}],"presets":[{"name":"Retro blog editorial"}],"tag":null,"class":"retro-blog-editorial"}
{% endschema %}